h, yeah."], [1, "And never got tired."], [0, "Yeah. You saw him in that. In the Hulk. Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah. It's something, man. That's. Talk about a legend."], [1, "Oh, real legend."], [0, "Yeah. Yeah, man."], [1, "Well, Hickson, there's a video of him, and he did this multiple times where he would go to these gyms and he would teach a seminar, like a long seminar, and then roll with all the black belts and just tap them one after the other. One\u2014 world champions, guys that just didn't understand what was going on. Like, how is this happening? Oh yeah, like Paulo Filho when he was a WEC world champion and he was\u2014 he had won the Mundials, I believe. He'd won multiple jiu-jitsu championships. And he trained with Hickson. He's like, man, it's true. He goes, I can't believe it. He goes, that guy treated me like I didn't even belong in there. It was crazy. And Hickson by that time was probably like 40."]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": ["Comedy"]}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "infer_tags_from_a_conversation_window", "description": "Returns tags representing the conversation as a whole from the window received.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "conversation", "prompt_template": "Analyze conversation in terms of topic interests of the participants. Analyze the conversation (provided in structured XML format) where <p0> has the questions and <p1> has the answers. Return comma-delimited tags. Only return the tags without any English commentary.", "output_variable": "final_output", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["brazilian jiu jitsu", "mixed martial arts", "ufc history", "combat sports", "grappling", "martial arts legends", "weight classes", "submissions", "training methods", "cross training", "yoga", "flexibility", "breathing", "competi