t of entities with their types (e.g., 'John Smith (PERSON), ACM Corp (ORGANIZATION)). Only return the entities without any additional commentary.", "output_variable": "extracted_entities", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["city council of the city of boston", "city of boston", "city hall", "christopher a. iannella chamber", "president breadon", "councilor coletta zapata", "councilor culpepper", "councilor durkan", "councilor fitzgerald", "councilor flynn", "councilor louijeune", "councilor mejia", "councilor murphy", "councilor pep\u00e9n", "councilor santana", "councilor weber", "councilor worrell", "rabbi yitzhak aharon korff", "mayor\u2019s office of housing", "u.s. department of housing and urban development", "continuum of care grant funds", "$50", "000", "000.00", "federal fiscal year 2025"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
