 developments of suburban office buildings in locations with parking and transit advantages, he added. Converting office space to residential space can be a sustainable solution for enlivening neighborhoods and making the most of existing building stock."], [2, "New Study Offers Data-Driven Approach for Office-to-Housing ...\nMar 26, 2025 \u00b7 Through a combination of market analysis, stakeholder interviews, and architectural feasibility assessments, the study identifies four key levers that cities can use to facilitate office -to-residential conversions : Regulatory flexibility: Zoning and building code reforms, such as allowing conversions by-right, help to accelerate projects."], [3, "Analysis and Case Studies on Office-to-Housing Conversions\nSeattle rounds out the top 10 (1,709). Office - to-Housing Conversion Successes: Case Studies In the second component of the study , NAR Research analyzed the market conditions and the factors that led to the success of eight office-to-housing conversions in Maryland, Washington DC, New York, California, and Illinois."]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": null}, "prompt_chain": null, "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["office conversion", "adaptive reuse", "real estate development", "urban planning", "residential development", "housing conversion", "zoning reform", "building codes", "city planning", "market analysis", "housing supply", "mixed-use development", "commercial real estate", "residential real estate", "environmental remediation", "brownfields", "land cleanup", "environmental law", "tax credits", "financial incentives"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
