ns from the largest banks in the country and rapidly re-trade the unworked loans to secondary market investors at wholesale pricing.\u201d If you only want REO or Bulk REO Single Family Residential please click here If you are looking to buy less than $400,000 at one time ..."], [2, "Find Off-Market Note and REO Deals with BankProspector ...\nSee Non-Performing Asset Portfolios for Every Bank and Credit Union in the US Only BankProspector shows you which lenders are your best sellers for REO and non-performing notes in near real-time plus insight into who\u2019s selling. Get Contact Info Including Phone and Email for Decision Makers Lender direct deals are done between people."], [3, "Santander Bank to close a branch in Providence - Providence ...\nMay 5, 2025 \u00b7 Santander Bank plans to close six branches in Massachusetts and another dozen branches in Rhode Island , New Hampshire, New Jersey, New York and Pennsylvania."], [4, "Santander to close six bank branches in Massachusetts, one in ...\nMay 6, 2025 \u00b7 Santander is closing 18 bank branches across the Northeast, including six branches in Massachusetts and one in Providence, according to filings with federal regulators."], [5, "Santander Bank to close 18 branches, including Atwells Ave ...\nMay 9, 2025 \u00b7 In addition to the Rhode Island and Massachusetts branch closures , a branch in New Hampshire, plus another 10 branches scattered throughout Pennsylvania, New Jersey and New York City are also among the planned closures ."]], "participants": []}}, "prompt_chain": null, "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["real estate", "banking", "finance", "property data", "transaction records", "market trends", "reo properties", "foreclosure", "property auctions", "distressed assets", "nonperforming loans", "loan portfolios", "mortgage loans", "bulk sales", "secondary market", "wholesale pricing", "santander bank", "branch closures", "provid